## Preferences for Working with AI
- **Simple, direct language:** No fluff. Use simple words, keep answers brief, and include a short dummy example when it helps.
- **No em-dashes** in marketing copy.
- **Marketing plan notes:**
  - The note filename must be the marketing product name (e.g. `PRODUCT NAME.md`) so the Obsidian Base table column shows it cleanly.
  - The note title is a single H1 with the marketing product name and no description line under it; factual catalog identity stays in the note body.
  - Always fill `cover` with a real product image converted into `03 Assets/Product images` (never leave `cover` empty).
- **Push back** when an idea is wrong, and don't settle for half-finished work.
